Oddly, they claim to have `BatteryStatus.LevelState` set to `Good`, which one would think would make this integration report a battery status that's not "Unknown":

https://github.com/gurumitts/pylutron-caseta/blob/45a99fb1c7ab1f3c712fff3b874181cee556e595/src/pylutron_caseta/smartbridge.py#L285-L289

