1. Link an eWeLink account to SmartThings (SmartThings app → Add device → Partner devices → eWeLink) with a SONOFF S-MATE or an eWeLink remote in the account.
2. Reload the SmartThings integration in Home Assistant; `event.<name>_outletN_main` entities appear with `event_types: null` in their attributes.
