@clarkzinzow Yes, I confirmed that, at least in our inner HDFS. As I mentioned in the last message, for the second path, it throws an error saying "netloc/path2" is not available. But after I change this line: https://github.com/ray-project/ray/blob/master/python/ray/data/datasource/file_based_datasource.py#L450 to just returning the "path", it works.

